// Replace every PLACEHOLDER before you build.
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is the 10-character Team ID from developer.apple.com/account.
// Create the App Group in the developer portal (Xcode can do this once the team is real).
// The app and the widget both read these values. Keep the three lines in sync with the README.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = PLACEHOLDER
TOLKEINS_APP_GROUP = group.PLACEHOLDER.tolkeins
TOLKEINS_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = app.PLACEHOLDER.tolkeins
